  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposed use due to the nature and type of goods sold to trade customers, is considered to be an acceptable use within Amalgamated Drive that will not have an adverse affect upon the parking and servicing requirements of the building. This is in accordance with policies ENV.B.1.1 (New Development), E.1.3 (Location of General Industry (B2) and Storage and Distribution (B8) uses) and T.1.4 (Car and Cycle Parking and Servicing of Development) of the Adopted London Borough of Hounslow Unitary Development Plan 2003.",
    "Condition : 2 - The use hereby permitted for the storage and distribution of kitchens, bedrooms, bathrooms and associated accessories, and joinery products; with account holder's only trade counter and collection point shall be carried on only by Howdens Joinery Ltd for the period during which the premises are occupied the said company."
